{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321415001:1":{"text":"今度は何だい？まさか、また酔い覚ましをくれとか言うんじゃないでしょうね！","source_cn":"你们怎么又来了？解酒的东西可不能多喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7095F8CE1777DB6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321415002:1":{"text":"ち、違いますよ！人探しに来ただけです！さっき若い男性がここを通りませんでしたか？","source_cn":"不不不，我们是来找人的！刚才有没有一个年轻男人经过这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6756AF3EB1413D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321415003:1":{"text":"ここにいる少年に顔がちょっと似ていて……お酒の匂いがしたはずです。","source_cn":"外貌特点的话……嗯，他长得和我们身边这个小朋友有点像，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B893F913AC7940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321415004:1":{"text":"ああ、それなら確かに、そんな感じの若者がさっき通っていったよ。","source_cn":"噢，刚才的确有那么个年轻人经过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE17DB15A182600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321415005:1":{"text":"自分は臆病者じゃないとか一人でブツブツ呟いててねぇ。","source_cn":"他过去的时候，还嘟嘟囔囔地说着什么，好像是在说自己不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAEF87606CAA8817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321415006:1":{"text":"ど、どこに行ったか分かる？","source_cn":"那、那您知道他去哪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB128CFA587EA5514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321415007:1":{"text":"ねぇ、坊や。この洞窟は一本道。出口を除いてどこかに行けると思うかい？","source_cn":"嘿，小伙子，矿洞就这么大，除了另一个出口，他还能去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79863693A6035D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321415008:1":{"text":"出口……！そっちには<style=\"highlight\">古戦場</style>があります！生きた屍がうろついてる場所ですよ！","source_cn":"另一个出口？！那边可是<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CD894B473EA9135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321415009:1":{"text":"そ……そんな……","source_cn":"什……什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0659A04B95BFF9BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321415010:1":{"text":"マスター！急いで追いかけましょう！万が一でもあったら大変です！","source_cn":"主人，我们得赶快追上他！万一碰到活死人就不好了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE69E92082013170A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター！急いで追いかけましょう！万が一でもあったら大変です！","female":"マスター！急いで追いかけましょう！万が一でもあったら大変です！","variant_male_record_index":"148755","variant_female_record_index":"148756","document_title":"","docu